Package: svent-artwork
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: SventOS branding: wallpapers and logo
 Installs the SventOS wallpapers to /usr/share/backgrounds/svent (landscape and
 portrait) and the logo set to /usr/share/svent/logo. Shared by the XFCE and
 bspwm sessions through the svent-wallpaper selector provided by svent-core.
